@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-12 - Receive Payment Webhook

actor "PayOS Gateway" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB
participant "PayOS Gateway" as PayOS_Gateway
participant "Stripe Gateway" as Stripe_Gateway
participant "Gmail SMTP" as Gmail

PayOS_Gateway -> API: Webhook event
API -> Service: Verify and process webhook
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service -> PayOS_Gateway: Create/verify PayOS transaction
PayOS_Gateway --> Service: PayOS result
Service -> Stripe_Gateway: Create/confirm/refund payment
Stripe_Gateway --> Service: Stripe result
Service -> Gmail: Send notification email when configured
Gmail --> Service: Delivery accepted or warning logged
Service --> API: Webhook accepted
API --> PayOS_Gateway: HTTP 200

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Signature không hợp lệ -> 401 Unauthorized
  note over FE,Service: Bill đã PAID -> bỏ qua (idempotent)
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Payment đã được khởi tạo bởi PayOS/Stripe
Post: Order status được cập nhật
Main flow:
1. PayOS/Stripe gửi HTTP POST đến webhook endpoint
2. System verify signature (HMAC cho PayOS, Stripe SDK cho Stripe)
3. System kiểm tra idempotency (tránh xử lý trùng)
4. System cập nhật bill.paymentStatus = PAID
5. System gọi processStockAfterPayment để giảm stock
6. System gửi email confirmation
7. System trả về HTTP 200
end note
@enduml
